sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Chat as Chat page
    participant Service as Agent Service
    participant WF as Agent Workflow<br>(LangGraph)
    participant AI as Investigate Agent
    participant OpenAI
    participant Data as Operations data<br>+ action records
    participant Slack
    participant Store as Case store<br>+ paused workflows
    participant Admin as Operation Admin
    actor Manager as Ops manager

    Customer->>Chat: "My order ORD-1007 is 15 days late. I want a refund."
    Chat-->>Customer: shows the message + "Looking into it…"
    Chat->>Service: run_agent(message)
    Service->>WF: start (thread_id = request_id)

    Note over WF: Input Check: not empty, not too long, IDs found
    WF->>AI: Investigate
    loop read-only investigation
        AI->>OpenAI: reason about the request
        AI->>Data: get_order · get_customer · get_support_tickets
    end
    AI-->>WF: AgentProposal (summary, evidence, actions, reply draft)

    WF->>Data: Guardrails re-read the real data
    Note over WF: Severity HIGH · ticket: automatic · refund: needs approval
    Note over WF,Data: Early exit (invalid input, AI error, missing info, unknown order):<br>straight to Respond, no actions, no Slack

    WF->>Data: Run Safe Actions: create ticket TCK-2010, save R8-checked draft
    WF->>Data: Notify Operations: create approval APR-1001
    WF->>Slack: case report (severity, evidence, pending refund), tags the team
    WF->>Store: Human Approval: pause and save the workflow state
    WF-->>Service: paused (awaiting approval)
    Service->>Store: save the case
    Service-->>Chat: reply draft
    Chat-->>Customer: "Your refund request is being reviewed by our team"

    loop every 3 seconds while the refund is pending
        Chat->>Service: get_case
    end

    Manager->>Admin: open "Waiting for approval"
    Admin->>Service: list_cases
    Manager->>Admin: Approve
    Admin->>Service: resume_agent(APR-1001: approve)
    Service->>WF: resume
    WF->>Store: load the paused state
    WF->>Data: issue_refund → RFD-0001
    WF->>Slack: thread reply "✅ Refund approved · RFD-0001"
    Note over WF: Customer notice from a fixed template (not AI) · Respond
    WF-->>Service: completed
    Service->>Store: update the case

    Chat->>Service: get_case (next poll)
    Service-->>Chat: decision notice
    Chat-->>Customer: "Good news: your refund of 249.99 USD was approved (RFD-0001)"
